d="M8 11h.01"></path><path d="M8 16h.01"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Feasibility Studies &amp; DPRs</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Data-driven feasibility studies and detailed project reports for expansion, new ventures and funding.</p></article><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-map size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.106 5.553a2 2 0 0 0 1.788 0l3.659-1.83A1 1 0 0 1 21 4.619v12.764a1 1 0 0 1-.553.894l-4.553 2.277a2 2 0 0 1-1.788 0l-4.212-2.106a2 2 0 0 0-1.788 0l-3.659 1.83A1 1 0 0 1 3 19.381V6.618a1 1 0 0 1 .553-.894l4.553-2.277a2 2 0 0 1 1.788 0z"></path><path d="M15 5.764v15"></path><path d="M9 3.236v15"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Strategic Roadmap</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Short, medium and long-term strategic planning with clear milestones, priorities and accountability.</p></article></section></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Results We Have Delivered</h2></section><div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6"><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold">Manufacturing</p><h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Rubber &amp; Plastics Manufacturer</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Declining on-time delivery, rising material wastage, zero floor accountabili